(`[--all] [--threshold N] ...`, \"compact only above N events\"), but the `--all` path rejects it. Observed 2026-11-09 against the production MCP build 0f409b946e4:\n\n- `rebar store compact --all --dry-run --threshold 8` -> `Error: unknown option '--threshold'`.\n- The single-ticket form accepts only `--threshold=N` (`src/rebar/_commands/compact.py:46,92`).\n- `REBAR_COMPACT_THRESHOLD=8 rebar store compact --all --dry-run` works.\n\nAn operator following the help text can't scope a store-wide sweep's threshold.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `rebar store compact --all` accepts `--threshold N` and `--threshold=N` as its help states (or the help states what it accepts); a test pins help text and parser behaviour together.\n- [ ] The single-ticket form accepts both spellings too.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0369-ba7f-d5ab-4ba9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"store compact --help lists --threshold for --all, but --all rejects it","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f9adc3af-1aa6-4336-bc22-0663b4ca010c","c9780bda-5aac-4447-ada5-7888429274a4"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794250427081677002,"uuid":"865866bc-642f-4836-9d0b-dc7572d80aac"}